cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NIYAM, please cite it as below."
title: "NIYAM: building bye-laws as machine checks (research prototype)"
type: software
license: MIT
version: submission-v1
date-released: 2026-11-25
abstract: >-
  NIYAM turns sentences from Indian building bye-laws (MBBL 2016 and the Telangana Building Rules 2012 base text)
  into IDS 1.0 files and sandboxed Python checks, keeps a draft only if a verifier gate accepts it on test models,
  and audits IFC4 models with HTML, JSON and BCF 2.1 output. A decision aid, not a legal approval tool.
  Team Abhyudaya, entry to the DBI 2026 Student Competition (CDCPIndia / buildingSMART India); mentor Dr. Lanke Pallavi.
keywords: [IFC, IDS, BCF, openBIM, automated compliance checking, building bye-laws, LLM]
